---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Vigilo
    participant ControlDB as Control DB
    participant ExecDB as Execution DBs

    User->>Vigilo: vigilo run cancel
    activate Vigilo
    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Parse run id
    Vigilo->>ControlDB: Lock run and mark cancellation requested
    ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Run status

    alt Run does not exist
        Vigilo-->>User: Run not found error
    else Run is completed or failed
        Vigilo-->>User: Cancellation error
    else Run is already cancelled
        Vigilo->>ControlDB: Mark dispatch cursors drained
        Vigilo->>ControlDB: Resolve readable execution routes
        ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Route list
        Vigilo->>ExecDB: Idempotently cancel local work and record missing receipts
        ExecDB-->>Vigilo: Cancellation counts
        Vigilo->>ControlDB: Refresh cancellation summary and event
        Vigilo-->>User: Success response
    else Run is pending, running, finalizing or in blob preparation
        Vigilo->>ControlDB: Mark dispatch cursors drained
        Vigilo->>ControlDB: Resolve readable execution routes
        ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Route list
        Vigilo->>ExecDB: Lock chunks, cancel open work, and commit immutable receipts
        ExecDB-->>Vigilo: Cancellation counts and summaries
        Vigilo->>ControlDB: Persist final cancellation summary
        Vigilo->>ControlDB: Enqueue run.cancelled
        Vigilo-->>User: Success response
    end
    Note over Vigilo,ControlDB: Blob preparation has no admitted execution routes, cancellation fences plan publication.
    deactivate Vigilo
